    "narrative": "The Austin Waves offense faces a challenging slate today, headlined by the elite 81.88 efficiency score of **Gunnar Henderson**. Facing Emerson Hancock, **Gunnar Henderson** benefits from a massive 16% park factor boost and favorable dynamic platoon splits, positioning him as the clear anchor of the lineup despite the presence of a 44% SB-rate hold from the opposing battery. Conversely, **Miguel Andujar** (65.09) and **Jackson Merrill** (60.98) emerge as high-upside plays against Andrew Abbott. Abbott\u2019s high 4.76 xERA serves as the primary catalyst here, offering a high-floor environment for both hitters, though **Jackson Merrill** faces a slight drag due to a 13% negative platoon adjustment that suppresses his overall efficiency score relative to his teammate.\n\nThe most difficult decision for today\u2019s rotation involved **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.**, who barely clung to a starting role with a 59.62 score. While he has to contend with the tough 3.46 xERA of Logan Webb, the optimizer prioritized his #2 lineup placement and the projected wind-out conditions at the stadium to boost his base projection. On the bench, **Nasim Nunez** was the closest omission, falling short with a 42.64 score. While **Nasim Nunez** offers potential for stolen bases\u2014a critical scarcity for the Waves\u2014his projected #8 spot in the order significantly diluted his scoring potential, and the optimizer favored the higher run-production likelihood of the starters over his limited efficiency in a bottom-of-the-order role.\n\nRisk management remains a priority given that several key positions, including those held by **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** (56.35) and **Curtis Mead** (47.29), are facing top-tier pitching talent. **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** is grappling with Cristopher S\u00e1nchez\u2019s elite 2.74 xERA, which forces a sharp 19% downgrade to his scoring floor. Similarly, **Curtis Mead** is essentially a marginal start, saved from the bench only by the wind-out projections and his favorable platoon split. Managers should monitor official lineups closely, as the \"Lineup Pending\" status for all starters introduces variance that could impact the 60% recency weight currently applied to these projections. Meanwhile, we continue to stash **Kyle Tucker** and **Luis Robert Jr.**, hoping for a return to health to bolster our category depth.",
